on Wait ticks
  [  0] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [  2] extcall 25 .............................. startTimer()
  [  4] pushint8 34 ............................. <34>
  [  6] get 7 ................................... <the timer>
  [  8] getparam 0 .............................. <ticks>
  [ 10] lt ...................................... <the timer < ticks>
  [ 11] jmpifz [ 20] ............................ repeat while the timer < ticks
  [ 14] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 16] extcall 26 .............................. nothing()
  [ 18] endrepeat [  4]
  [ 20] ret
end
